{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Therefore</b> — if you do not heed, the evil shall come upon you; in every street there shall be lamentation." "<b>Ho, ho</b> — deficient [in] yod, like הוי." "<b>And the farmer shall call to the mourner</b> — for they shall not reap what they sowed, just as they shall not drink the wine of their vineyards; therefore."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:08.259686431Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}